{"version":1,"key":"quest:71","content":{"id":71,"title":"HTML 中 <dialog> 元素的使用？","summary":"暂未记录答案","target":{"key":"quest:71","type":"quest","id":71},"groupId":2,"groupTitle":"前端","groupColor":"mint-green","status":"resolved","answers":[],"materials":[{"index":1,"kind":"card","group":"note","title":"dialog 标签的模态与非模态用法","meta":"","excerpt":"<dialog> 标签允许你创建一个模态或者非模态的对话框 模态：对话框打开时，脱离文档流以及页面的层级体系，位于最上层，页面上的其他部分无法交互非模态：对话框打开时，仍然在文档流中，用户也可以与页面中的其他元素交互 可以使用 :modal 伪类区分是普通对话框还是模态对话框dialog:modal {\n  /* 模态","target":{"key":"card:665","type":"card","id":665},"citeKey":"card:665"}],"trail":[{"time":1746881218383,"tone":"start","text":"提出问题","refs":[]},{"time":1760102506602,"tone":"milestone","text":"写下卡片","refs":[1]},{"time":1760102506603,"tone":"done","text":"标为已解决","refs":[]}],"createTime":1746881218383,"updateTime":1746881218383,"resolvedTime":1760102506603},"meta":{"type":"quest","publishTime":1746881218383}}